messages.text:
Watching people practicing
makes me want to get moving, too!{be01}
Soooooo, let's practice
Pokémon battles.{be01}

It's way more fun to have a battle
ourselves than watching{be00}
other people practicing!

We usually cheer for other people,
but today we would like{be00}
to gather our courage{be00}
and have our own Pokémon battle.{be01}

I am not good at sports,
but I enjoy sports in my own way--{be00}
by cheering my heart out for people!
